-- To-do 405 (SmartAI check on mobs, batch 6: Feralas, Tanaris, ArathiHighlands, Desolace, Dustwallow, ThousandNeedles, StranglethornJungle, TheCapeOfStranglethorn): 48 creatures cast spells on retail but have no script, or only the old 3.3.5 script, in our world DB.
-- Cause: our smart_scripts for these entries come from the alexkulya import (identical to ref_alex) or are missing; the Cataclysm sniff data (ref_cpp) has SmartAI with the retail casts for them.
-- Change: port the ref_cpp SmartAI (smart_scripts source_type 0 + 5 timed action lists) for 48 creatures (16 new, 32 replacing an unchanged alexkulya script); AIName set to SmartAI for 16 entries that had none.
-- Schema/enum mapping: target_param4 = 0; event_flags 512 (WHILE_CHARMED in TC master; RAID40 difficulty in our core, would disable the event) dropped, 256 -> 0x10000 (DONT_RESET); action 27 COMBAT_STOP -> 203, 85 SELF_CAST -> 11 CAST with flag 0x10, 134 INVOKER_CAST -> 85; cast triggerFlags/targetsLimit (param3/4) = 0.
-- Source: ref_cpp (Cataclysm Preservation Project TDB434.22011, sniff-based) smart_scripts/creature_text/waypoints/conditions, rows copied 1:1 apart from the mapping above. Every spell id checked against the 5.4.8 client Spell.dbc + SpellEffect.dbc on dev (exists, has effects, name matches the ref_cpp comment). Not yet seen in game.
-- Rollback: rollback/405_batch6_rollback.sql (re-inserts the 32 replaced old scripts, deletes the ported rows, resets AIName for the 16 entries that had none).
-- Rollback (short, loses the replaced old scripts of 4334,4359,23595,2595,2586,2572,2592,2588,2570,2605,2733,2793,39896,5254,4664,4663,4665,4681,4673,4671,4668,5460,5458,5427,5420,5454,5646,8204,1907,4505,2521,1493): DELETE FROM smart_scripts WHERE source_type=0 AND entryorguid IN (4334,4359,23595,1061,17207,2595,2586,2621,2572,2592,2588,2570,2605,2733,2793,7939,39896,39733,8147,5251,5254,5366,7726,44400,5343,7956,43488,4664,4663,4665,4681,4673,4671,4668,36134,5460,5458,5427,5420,5454,5646,8204,38649,1907,4505,2521,43542,1493); DELETE FROM smart_scripts WHERE source_type=9 AND entryorguid IN (6800,6801,6802,6803,6804); UPDATE creature_template SET AIName='' WHERE entry IN (1061,17207,2621,7939,39733,8147,5251,5366,7726,44400,5343,7956,43488,36134,38649,43542);

